---
title: Installation (v1)
summary: The legacy v1 install path, kept for archived projects.
---

This is the **v1** installation page. It exists to prove versioned corpora coexist in one nav —
switch the Version dropdown in the header to jump between v1 and v2.

## Install v1

```bash
npm install ogygia@1
```

v1 pins the older plugin API. New projects should use v2.

## Next

See [quick start](quick-start) for the v1 mounting steps.
